"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[33788],{33788:function(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/9c9e0a4152315f87af85d2e03d7b4329.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Jangsangni Makguksu Yangyang Main Branch\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Korean Food\\"\\n  address=\\"10 Jangsan 1-gil, Ganghyeon-myeon, Yangyang-gun, Gangwon-do\\"\\n  rating=4\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Ordered\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Dongchimi Mul-makguksu\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4\\n}\\n---\\nThe icy dongchimi broth is good.\\n```\\n## Review\\nIt takes some time because they pull the noodles themselves when you order, but it\'s not a problem at all.  \\nThere was a way to eat it deliciously, so I followed it.  \\nThere is no separate bibim; you eat it as bibim and then add the icy dongchimi broth they gave you separately to eat it as mul-makguksu.  \\nI recommend adding extra noodles!\\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\\" src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/d9ecefe3b8b03fbdd47e50602fd70512.jpg\\" alt=\\"Jangsangni Makguksu Yangyang Main Branch\\">\\n<img style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\\" src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/1d621a9af1203ba333b0c5579875fa17.jpg\\" alt=\\"Jangsangni Makguksu Yangyang Main Branch\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);